!!! oculus/input/key-mapping.mat
!!! Physical key codes to logical symbols.
!!!
!!! The kernel reports physical key codes. This module maps
!!! them to logical symbols the application understands.

book oculus.input.key-mapping

read everything from ny.lang.core

!!! A physical key code (from the keyboard hardware).

public key-code begin choice
    when Unmapped
    when Escape
    when Return
    when Space
    when Tab-key
    when Backspace
    when Delete
    when Up
    when Down
    when Left
    when Right
    when F1
    when F2
    when F3
    when F4
    when F5
    when F6
    when F7
    when F8
    when F9
    when F10
    when F11
    when F12
    when A
    when B
    when C
    when D
    when E
    when F
    when G
    when H
    when I
    when J
    when K
    when L
    when M
    when N
    when O
    when P
    when Q
    when R
    when S
    when T
    when U
    when V
    when W
    when X
    when Y
    when Z
    when Digit0
    when Digit1
    when Digit2
    when Digit3
    when Digit4
    when Digit5
    when Digit6
    when Digit7
    when Digit8
    when Digit9
end choice
